[kernel] Parsing conditional2.c (with preprocessing)
[alias] Parsing done
[alias] May-aliases at the end of function main:
  {d; &e; *c; *&d} are aliased
  {a; b; &c} are aliased
  {c; &d; *a; *b; *&c} are aliased
[alias] Functions done
Before statement b = & c; :
 

Before statement c = & d; :
 {b; &c} are aliased
{c; *b; *&c} are aliased


Before statement d = & e; :
 {b; &c} are aliased
{c; &d; *b; *&c} are aliased
{d; *c; *&d} are aliased


Before statement if (a) a = b; else a = & c; :
 {b; &c} are aliased
{c; &d; *b; *&c} are aliased
{d; &e; *c; *&d} are aliased


Before statement a = b; :
 {b; &c} are aliased
{c; &d; *b; *&c} are aliased
{d; &e; *c; *&d} are aliased


Before statement a = & c; :
 {b; &c} are aliased
{c; &d; *b; *&c} are aliased
{d; &e; *c; *&d} are aliased


Before statement __retres = 0; :
 {d; &e; *c; *&d} are aliased
{a; b; &c} are aliased
{c; &d; *a; *b; *&c} are aliased


Before statement return __retres; :
 {d; &e; *c; *&d} are aliased
{a; b; &c} are aliased
{c; &d; *a; *b; *&c} are aliased


[alias] Analysis complete
